+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; script-src-attr 'none'; style-src 'self'; style-src-attr 'none'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'none'; connect-src 'none'; frame-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; worker-src 'none'; manifest-src 'none'; require-trusted-types-for 'script'; trusted-types 'none'">
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
+  <title>Privacy | The Daily Grind</title>
+</head>
+<body>
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
+    <a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a>
+    <a href="/">Back to home</a>
+  </nav>
+  <main class="container privacy-copy">
+    <h1>Your privacy at The Daily Grind</h1>
+    <p>This notice covers the public coffee website. You can browse it without providing personal information.</p>
+    <h2>What this website collects</h2>
+    <p>The pages do not use analytics, advertising trackers, fingerprinting, cookies, or browser storage. There are no data collection forms or client-side scripts.</p>
+    <h2>Images and third parties</h2>
+    <p>Images and styles are served from this website. Browsing these pages does not load third-party fonts, scripts, or images.</p>
+    <h2>Hosting and connection information</h2>
+    <p>Your browser sends connection information, including your IP address and requested page, to the hosting provider to deliver the website. The provider may keep access or security logs. Hosting log retention depends on the deployed provider; it is not controlled by these pages.</p>
+    <h2>Accounts and orders</h2>
+    <p>This static website does not implement accounts, rewards, checkout, or personal data storage. If these services become available, their collection purposes, providers, retention, and access or deletion options must be explained before you provide information.</p>
+    <h2>Your choices</h2>
+    <p>There are no optional tracking features to switch off and no profile stored by these pages to export or delete. You do not need to accept cookies to browse.</p>
+  </main>
+  <footer><p>&copy; 2026 The Daily Grind Coffee Co.</p></footer>
+</body>
+</html>
